---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Research
permalink: /research/
fullBleed: true
---
<div class="container research-intro">
  <h1>Research</h1>

  <p>Building upon a strong foundation of wet-lab molecular experiments and moving from basic mechanisms towards clinical interventions, our laboratory aims to accelerate discovery by seamlessly integrating bioinformatics with advanced AI-assisted analyses. Our lab follows four major research directions.</p>
</div>

<section class="research-topics">
  {% for topic in research.topics %}
  <article class="topic">
    <div class="topic-inner">
      <div class="topic-text">
        <h2 class="topic-title">{{ topic.title }}</h2>
        {% for paragraph in topic.paragraphs %}
        <p>{{ paragraph }}</p>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>

      <div class="topic-figure">
        {% if topic.image %}
        <img src="{{ topic.image }}" alt="{{ topic.alt }}">
        {% else %}
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
          <rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="2"></rect>
          <path d="M3 15l5-4 4 3 3-2 6 4"></path>
          <circle cx="8.5" cy="8.5" r="1.5"></circle>
        </svg>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
  {% endfor %}
</section>
